e interacted with by hand so that you can pick up and gesturally manipulate the motherboard 3D model as though it were a real object.\n\nDesigned for Quest 3", "short_description": "Mixed Reality tutorial of what an ATX Motherboard is and does!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oBtlnMD_c65F8GxmVGqSA0sBIH9n4hF3/view", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oBtlnMD_c65F8GxmVGqSA0sBIH9n4hF3/view", "publisher_name": "Enrico Arapi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://hydr.in/9f6b", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7784916498242551"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982516_1141742593734933_6732082486406500208_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qjj7Bwrlg0Q7kNvwG3mvYA&_nc_oc=AdqtgNJC7hPzIwj8nZWjSrkaacCe8FEEHu4Ys5cdKcvI5QgsbZFDEBI4bc2QMOQZgy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRI1mITShkoHVa_iKoKAbh8u-lVaFC0ntagf-OUppZew&oe=6B03177A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "ATX Motherboard Tutorial", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"